        "product_faq": [
          {
            "question": "Are you a factory or a trading company?",
            "answer": "We are a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with overseas B2B buyers on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects."
          },
          {
            "question": "What is your minimum order quantity?",
            "answer": "Small trial orders are welcome for existing styles; the minimum quantity is shown on each product page. For custom orders, the MOQ depends on the design, materials, branding and packaging."
          },
          {
            "question": "Can I mix colors and sizes in one order?",
            "answer": "Yes. Mixed colors and sizes are supported for existing styles. Mixed-style orders can also be discussed according to the selected styles and order quantity."
          },
          {
            "question": "Can I order samples before a bulk order?",
            "answer": "Yes. Samples can be arranged for you to check the workmanship and fit before bulk ordering. Sample and courier costs are quoted before payment."
          },
          {
            "question": "What packaging options do you offer?",
            "answer": "Shoe boxes and polybags are available packing options. Custom boxes, labels and carton markings can be planned around your order and brand requirements."
          },
          {
            "question": "Do you support logo customization and OEM/ODM?",
            "answer": "Yes. We work with buyers on branding and footwear development. Send your logo artwork or design reference, target quantity and market requirements so we can develop a suitable proposal."
          },
          {
            "question": "What is the lead time?",
            "answer": "Lead time depends on product availability, order quantity and customization. Existing styles can usually be arranged sooner; the production or dispatch schedule is agreed when confirming the order."
          },
          {
            "question": "How can you arrange shipping?",
            "answer": "Samples and small shipments can use express courier. Bulk shipments can be planned by sea or air, or through your appointed forwarder. Send your destination and delivery target for a freight quotation."
          }
        ],
